1. Created a proper mock user data object
2. Created the `enrichedWithUserProfileForm` object with all required properties
3. Added the `enrichedWithUserProfileForm` prop to the ImportedComponent
4. Added the `appUrl` prop which is also required
5. Ensured all the necessary user and team data is properly structured

This should resolve the error about accessing the user property, as we're now providing the enriched form data with the user information that the component needs.

